  <data key="d17">Paper</data>
  <data key="d18">Tuning the Performance of Single-Atom Electrocatalysts: Support-Induced Structural Reconstruction</data>
  <data key="d19">Study comparing support-free and support-assisted pyrolysis-derived single-atom electrocatalysts.</data>
</node>
